  { q: 'What is AEO?', a: "Answer engine optimization. Some people call it GEO, generative engine optimization. Same job: when somebody asks ChatGPT, Google AI, Perplexity, or Gemini who they should call, the assistant names two or three businesses. AEO is the work of making sure you're one of them." },
